WEBVTT

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.029
Young hearts.

00:01:46.351 --> 00:01:47.687
Duty calls.

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:21.902
A welcome invitation

00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:52.919
Dear Miss Vang:
It would please my parents and
myself very much, if you...

00:02:52.963 --> 00:02:57.712
would like to spend your summer
vacation here at the vicarage. Tell
me which day and train you will...

00:02:57.771 --> 00:03:02.895
be arriving on, and I'll pick you up
at the station. Kind regards,
Knud Svane.

00:03:54.618 --> 00:03:56.223
Summer vacation.

00:04:43.695 --> 00:04:46.710
A sunday at the vicarage.

00:06:08.728 --> 00:06:11.195
The travelling circus.

00:06:47.202 --> 00:06:50.641
...in the field behind the inn.
Performances by all artists.
Special attraction! Never seen before!

00:06:50.671 --> 00:06:54.002
Mr. Rudolph.
Cowboy and Wrangler.
The tightrope dancer. Miss Evelyn...

00:07:01.343 --> 00:07:03.334
A fatal promise.

00:07:48.846 --> 00:07:51.914
First time in Gjerlev!
Circus Fortuna.
Tonight amazing Galla performance...

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.970
in the large tent in the field
behind the inn. Performances
by all artists.

00:08:15.055 --> 00:08:17.014
After the show.

00:13:33.894 --> 00:13:38.429
I could not stay any longer.
I have escaped with the man I love.

00:13:38.507 --> 00:13:42.722
Never think about marrying me,
but forgive me. Magda.

00:14:33.781 --> 00:14:36.490
Some time later in Copenhagen.

00:14:36.623 --> 00:14:42.722
In the artists' hotel.

00:15:27.592 --> 00:15:30.985
A coincidence.

00:16:50.641 --> 00:16:53.482
A forced dance rehearsal.

00:18:30.931 --> 00:18:34.151
Destiny decided.

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:40.272
The scandal.

00:25:54.863 --> 00:25:56.435
Downhill

00:27:25.210 --> 00:27:26.643
A recognition.

00:28:08.895 --> 00:28:16.464
Dear Miss: A friend would like
to talk with you

00:29:09.871 --> 00:29:12.873
The bill must be paid.

00:30:04.956 --> 00:30:10.212
The one who must
earn the money.

00:31:47.793 --> 00:31:50.090
A wasted life.
